('nr-4582','naver-1576263375','naver','This is one of those cafes that is worth the trip. The plain egg tarts is my favorite. It''s taste has a hint of coconut and vanilla bean. The scones are a mixture of hard and soft, with the raspberry as the favorite. The coffee taste strong but not overbearing. They only offer cow milk for now. The staff is very friendly and pleasant. I recommend visiting even if not in your area! You will ♡ it!','2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
